{"scene_id": "s05199", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s05199.fountain", "heading": "INT. NGUYEN KITCHEN - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "KIT", "names": ["KIT"], "gender": "m", "first": 5, "spoke": 7}, {"id": 1, "name": "JO", "names": ["JO"], "gender": "m", "first": 7, "spoke": 7}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. NGUYEN KITCHEN - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Dark.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "A phone flashlight swings across the room and lands on a fridge covered in magnets.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "A neighbor's dog BARKS outside.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Through the window, two teenagers on a trampoline in the next yard use their phones as lanterns, shrieking with laughter.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Kit, 40s, pyjama bottoms and a \"World's Okayest Coach\" mug, stumbles in and sets down a laptop on the counter.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "It's at 4 percent.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Behind him Jo, 40s, his wife, in a team fleece, carries a stack of whiteboards under one arm and a bag of frozen peas under the other.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "The laptop lights up.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Slack, glowing, on screen.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "ON SCREEN: #coaches-all - Marcus: \"Anyone got the lineup for Saturday? lights are out here too lol\"", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "ON SCREEN: #coaches-all - Priya: \"Kit?? you're on the sheet\"", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "He winces.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Taps a key.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "The screen dims.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Battery saver. Battery saver.", "name": "KIT", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You said you'd print it.", "name": "JO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The printer needs power. It's literally in the name.", "name": "KIT", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "She slaps the peas onto the counter, sets down the boards, and starts scribbling in the dark with a marker that doesn't work.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "He holds the phone light over her shoulder while she draws Xs and Os and arrows pointing off the edge of the board.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "He frowns, she frowns, and the dog outside barks again, and the teenagers on the trampoline shout something about a penalty.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Left wing's a problem.", "name": "JO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Left wing's a Tuesday problem. It's a Saturday problem now.", "name": "KIT", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "She turns, glares, and holds out the marker.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "He takes it.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Tries it on the board.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Nothing.", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Shakes it.", "para": 7, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Tries again.", "para": 7, "sent": 5, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Nothing.", "para": 7, "sent": 6, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Give it here.", "name": "JO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "She snatches it back.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Bites the cap.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Presses hard.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "A faint grey line appears, then a clean black one, bold as a gunshot.", "para": 8, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "There.", "name": "JO", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You intimidated a marker.", "name": "KIT", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It knows who's in charge.", "name": "JO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "The laptop blinks.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "2 percent.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "ON SCREEN: #coaches-all - Marcus: \"ok we're going with 4-4-2 unless someone objects\"", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "ON SCREEN: #coaches-all - Priya: \"Kit?? last chance\"", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Kit lunges.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Jo lunges.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Their hands collide on the keyboard and the machine makes a tiny, dying chirp.", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "ON SCREEN: #coaches-all - Kit: \"4-3-3 left wing Danny, subs on at 60\"", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Send.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "The screen goes black.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "The darkness settles.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Even the dog stops.", "para": 15, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Was that right?", "name": "KIT", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No.", "name": "JO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "He laughs.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "She laughs.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "The fridge shudders on, the overhead light blinks to life, and every magnet on the door sings a little as the compressor catches.", "para": 16, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "They squint at each other in the sudden brightness.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "He's holding the marker.", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "She's holding the peas.", "para": 17, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Dinner?", "name": "KIT", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Peas.", "name": "JO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Peas.", "name": "KIT", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}]}